<title>BERMUDA: Sky Games names chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Sky Games names chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky Games International Ltd said Tuesday it has named Laurence Geller chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Geller and his company, Geller and Co, have been advisers to Sky Games since March. Geller became a director of the company in August.</p>
<p>The chairman's position is newly created. The previous chief executive, Malcolm Burke, remains as company president.</p>
